{
  "worldKey": "storm",
  "eyebrow": null,
  "title": "Bali",
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "When I first got to Bali, I felt like a square peg in a round hole.",
      "behavior": "unveil",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Unseen, out of place, faintly wrong.",
      "behavior": "hold",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "I know this nerve.",
      "behavior": "drift",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "I've met it before.",
      "behavior": "drift",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "And I know its only balm is time, which is annoying, because time is the one thing I can't optimize.",
      "behavior": "drift",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "So I did what I do with everything: I built a routine and clung to it like a life raft.",
      "behavior": "rush",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Beach walk, 6pm, every day.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "An anchor.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Very healthy.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Very stable.",
      "behavior": "drift",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Until the anchor tried to kill me.",
      "behavior": "swell",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The plan was the usual walk.",
      "behavior": "rush",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The execution was two-plus kilometres in the direction with the fewest people, because apparently my instinct for safety is \"go where no one could possibly help you.\"",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Denim shorts, black strapless top, hair gone full feral in the humidity, big bulky headphones on.",
      "behavior": "hold",
      "element": "phone",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "I tried to lose myself in the music.",
      "behavior": "rush",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "I succeeded.",
      "behavior": "drift",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Completely.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Literally.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "I stopped tracking the direction because ABBA was on and priorities are priorities.",
      "behavior": "drift",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "6pm became 7.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The moody sky became a raging storm.",
      "behavior": "drift",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine - not a storm.",
      "behavior": "hold",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "A torrential downpour.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "But you know how Mumbai girls are.",
      "behavior": "swell",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Rain?",
      "behavior": "hold",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Meh.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "We don't run.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Only it wasn't drizzle.",
      "behavior": "hold",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Five minutes in, soaked through to the bone.",
      "behavior": "hold",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "I finally look up and take stock of my surroundings, and my surroundings are: nothing.",
      "behavior": "drift",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Every shop shuttered.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "No clubs, no hotels, no people.",
      "behavior": "hold",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Just me, standing in what appeared to be the aftermath of a minor flood, dressed for a rooftop bar.",
      "behavior": "unveil",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Breathe in.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Breathe out.",
      "behavior": "drift",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    },
    {
      "text": "ABBA is still here.",
      "behavior": "hold",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": true
    },
    {
      "text": "That's something.",
      "behavior": "tremor",
      "element": "none",
      "loud": false
    }
  ]
}